{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1094", "sample_idx": 20, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "```json\n{\n  \"famous_moms\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Marilyn Monroe (née Norma Jeane Mortenson)\",\n      \"title\": \"The Ultimate 'Happy Birthday, Mr. President' Icon\",\n      \"why_famous\": \"Because nothing says ‘mom’ like a blonde bombshell who made JFK blush and James Dean swoon, while also being the world’s most relatable surrogate aunt for every angsty teen’s daydream.\",\n      \"fun_fact\": \"Her real name was longer than a *Friends* rerun marathon, and she once wore a giant white dress that looked like it was made from a cloud’s leftovers.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Prince Harry’s Mum (aka Princess Diana, aka the People’s Princess, aka the Human Tornado of Charity)\",\n      \"title\": \"The Original ‘Mompreneur’ (Before Mompreneurs Were Cool)\",\n      \"why_famous\": \"She turned being a princess into a full-time job of hugging AIDS patients, planting landmines (symbolically, because she wasn’t *that* mom), and making the entire world wish they had her ability to cry in public without judgment.\",\n      \"fun_fact\": \"She once snuck into a children’s hospital in a wig to meet kids—because who needed an appointment when you had *that* much grace?\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Oprah Winfrey (Mom to America’s Emotional Support System)\",\n      \"title\": \"The Queen of ‘You Get a Car! You Get a Car!’ (And Also a Therapy Session)\",\n      \"why_famous\": \"She gave birth to a talk show empire, a book club that could topple governments, and a pesar of people who *still* text her ‘Dear Abby’ letters like it’s 1995.\",\n      \"fun_fact\": \"She once gave away *425 cars* in one giveaway—because why settle for one when you can be the mom who invented ‘overachieving’?\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Martha Stewart (The Pinterest Grandma Who Never Age)\",\n      \"title\": \"The Original ‘Life Hack’ Mom (Before ‘Life Hacks’ Were a Thing)\",\n      \"why_famous\": \"She turned cake decorating into a federal offense, prison time into a brand opportunity, and ‘homestyle’ into a million-dollar industry. Also, she once got arrested for *insider trading*—aka trying to corner the market on turkey prices like a capitalist hero.\",\n      \"fun_fact\": \"Her idea of ‘quality time’ is folding a fitted sheet while side-eyeing everyone else’s attempt at a ‘cozy’ home.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Beyoncé’s Mom, Tina Knowles (The Beyoncé Bootcamp Drill Sergeant)\",\n      \"title\": \"The OG ‘Work Hard, Shine Harder’ Coach (Before ‘Mom Goals’ Were a Hashtag)\",\n      \"why_famous\": \"Single-handedly raised Queen Bey, Solange, and Iyman while also being the human equivalent of a motivational poster that says ‘EXCELLENCE IS THE STANDARD.’\",\n      \"fun_fact\": \"Beyoncé’s entire *Lemonade* album is basically a love letter to her mom, but with more snapbacks and less ‘I’m worried about you’ side-eyes.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"metadata\": {\n    \"tone\": \"equal parts inspirational, sarcastic, and slightly unhinged (like a mom who’s had one too many coffees while scrolling TikTok)\",\n    \"disclaimer\": \"No moms were harmed in the creation of this list. (But some may have been *motivated* to hide their wine glasses.)\"\n  }\n}\n```", "logprobs": [{"token": "```", "logprob": -0.0015779199311509728}, {"token": "json", "logprob": -0.00044764988706447184}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.00882688071578741}, {"token": "{\n", "logprob": -0.002697521820664406}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.007607772946357727}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.003155611688271165}, {"token": "f", "logprob": -0.41964951157569885}, {"token": "amous", "logprob": -0.11940878629684448}, {"token": "_m", "logprob": -0.019172588363289833}, {"token": "oms", "logprob": -0.024927375838160515}, {"token": "\":", "logprob": -0.4116304814815521}, {"token": " [\n", "logprob": -0.16148783266544342}, {"token": "   ", "logp